error: a bare `T` has no methods
  --> methods.norn:35:5
   |
35 |     value.to_string()
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `to_string` called on a type parameter
   = note: `T` is opaque inside `describe`: without a bound it can only be moved, stored, matched by binding, or passed on

error: I64 has no method `Empty`
  --> methods.norn:42:19
   |
42 |     let a = Shape.Empty()
   |                   ^^^^^ no impl provides it
   = note: a method comes from a trait: an `impl` with a `fn Empty` taking I64 is what declares one

